"Drop the −128 bias when passing Y to ``yuv_to_*`` (:ref:`the yuv_to_* change"
" <v3_7_0_yuv>`)."
msgstr ""
"Abandonner le biais −128 lors du passage de Y à ``yuv_to_*`` (:ref:`la "
"modification de yuv_to_* <v3_7_0_yuv>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:193
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Tous les autres scripts fonctionnent sans changement."
